{
 "canvas": {
  "w": 1920,
  "h": 1080,
  "fps": 30,
  "bg": "#0b0d12"
 },
 "audio": [
  {
   "id": "n0",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": 0.6,
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "[Kokoro](/kˈQkəɹQ/) reads what you write, not what you mean. Here are nine ways to make it say what you mean."
  },
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n0.out+1.1",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "Names first. [Kokoro](/kˈQkəɹQ/) guesses words it doesn't know, and it guesses my name wrong. A phoneme link in the text fixes it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n1.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Ask Muninn."
  },
  {
   "id": "a1",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b1.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Ask [Muninn](/mˈunɪn/)."
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a1.out+1.1",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "Write those phonemes in [Kokoro](/kˈQkəɹQ/)'s own alphabet. A plain keyboard g is not in it, and the model drops it without a word."
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n2.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "[Huginn](/hˈugɪn/) and [Muninn](/mˈunɪn/)."
  },
  {
   "id": "a2",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b2.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "[Huginn](/hˈuɡɪn/) and [Muninn](/mˈunɪn/)."
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a2.out+2.7",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "Stress is the only emphasis it has, and plus two is the ceiling. A word that must land needs a fragment of its own."
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n3.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "I never said [she](+2) stole it."
  },
  {
   "id": "a3",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b3.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Her? I never said she stole it."
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a3.out+2.7",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "Numbers and abbreviations trip it up. Leading zeros vanish, and St. becomes a saint."
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n4.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Agent 007 lives on Main St."
  },
  {
   "id": "a4",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b4.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Agent [007](/dˈʌbᵊl ˈO sˈɛvən/) lives on Main Street."
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a4.out+1.1",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "It picks between homographs by grammar, and habits fool it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n5.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "I read books every night."
  },
  {
   "id": "a5",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b5.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "I [read](/ɹˈid/) books every night."
  },
  {
   "id": "n6",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a5.out+1.1",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "Punctuation sets the pauses, and a quarter of a second is the most you get."
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n6.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Write the scene, check it, render it."
  },
  {
   "id": "a6",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b6.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "Write the scene. Check it. Render it."
  },
  {
   "id": "n7",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a6.out+2.7",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "One thing it can't do. Questions don't rise. Every voice we tested fell at the end."
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n7.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "You're ready."
  },
  {
   "id": "a7",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b7.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.85,
   "text": "You're ready?"
  },
  {
   "id": "n8",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a7.out+2.7",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "At its default rate, it talks fast. A rate near point eight lands in a comfortable range."
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n8.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 1.0,
   "text": "The checker tells you what is wrong before you render it."
  },
  {
   "id": "a8",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b8.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "rate": 0.8,
   "text": "The checker tells you what is wrong before you render it."
  },
  {
   "id": "n9",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a8.out+2.7",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "Last, voices blend. Repeat a voice to weight it. The voice you have been hearing is two parts fable to one part lewis."
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "n9.out+0.5",
   "speaker": "bm_fable",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "I keep what matters."
  },
  {
   "id": "a9",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "b9.out+0.6",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "I keep what matters."
  },
  {
   "id": "n10",
   "role": "voice",
   "at": "a9.out+1.1",
   "speaker": "bm_fable,bm_fable,bm_lewis",
   "rate": 0.95,
   "text": "All nine are written up, with the measurements, in the making Kinescript videos skill."
  }
 ],
